text:
{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 1074 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Fluconazole has been on FDA's shortage list since 2022-01-13 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a span of 57 months.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The registered manufacturing plant Novitium Pharma LLC (FEI 3012541241) received a VAI classification on 2019-02-04, which was 1074 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The relabeler Golden State Medical Supply, Inc. (FEI 3006458969) has a history including an OAI classification on 2011-02-02 and a Warning Letter on 2011-04-26, though its most recent inspection was NAI on 2025-06-11.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E5", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 164 tablets of the 50 mg presentation with 12.8 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 289 tablets with 17.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from ANI Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional alternate manufacturers not on the shortage list include Aurobindo Pharma Limited and AvPAK, each also lacking a placeable plant on their labels.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    }
  ]
}
